.TH murk-recover 1  "recover " 
.SH NAME
murk\-recover \- Print the BIP39 recovery phrase for the key murk resolves (MURK_KEY, MURK_KEY_FILE or the stored key for .murk)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmurk recover\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
